# Loaded by `vite build` (mode production) on top of .env.local, and committed:
# it holds no secret. Production signs in through its own origin — the Pages
# Function at functions/__/auth proxies Firebase's OAuth handler so the
# hand-back is same-site (docs/auth-domain-runbook.md). localhost keeps
# ci-connects.firebaseapp.com from .env.local.
VITE_FIREBASE_AUTH_DOMAIN=ci-events.pages.dev
